{
  "version": "post-ga-enterprise-hardening-resource-catalog-v2-court-rules-redundancy",
  "purpose": "Authoritative and review-supporting Maine family-law resource targets for local enterprise collection. Downloaded resources are written to an external data root and are never committed to the source repository.",
